Original change's description:
> [HLS] Intercept data: URLs in HlsDataSourceProviderImpl
>
> When HLS gets a data: url, it must be loaded directly, rather than pass
> through chrome's network stack and become interceptable by workers.
>
> There doesn't seem to be a way around including the net/base/data_url in
> the media deps, but it's a pretty small include (ie, not all of +net)
